{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774486836624,"story":{"title":"Dino Dance Rescue","userPrompt":"Dinosaurs doing a dance battle, while escaping an incoming fierce tornado","authorStyleId":"margaret-wise-brown","readingLevel":"early","illustrationStyleId":"cartoon_comic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"In a land of green, lived dinos so grand. Papa Dino, Mama too, and little Dino Dan. They loved to play, all through the day, with smiles and happy glee. But winds began to blow that day.","illustrationPrompt":"Papa Dino, Mama Dino, and little Dino Dan stand in a lush green valley, smiling. Wind gently rustles the trees. Sky is bright blue. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1774486329790,"durationMs":7233,"retries":0,"promptLength":1109,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A large Deep teal scales with a mustard yellow stripe down his back. Parasaurolophus, Medium Amber eyes with happy expression, Large, curved crest on head, Slightly chipped tooth, Broad chest, Small, friendly smile, Stocky build. A large Soft lavender scales with a light pink belly. Parasaurolophus, Medium Emerald green eyes with happy expression, Slightly shorter crest than Papa Dino, A small flower tucked behind her ear (always), Gentle eyes, Graceful posture, Average build. A small Bright sky-blue scales with a sunny yellow tail. Parasaurolophus, Big-expressive Chocolate brown eyes with happy expression, Small crest just starting to grow, One small, bright orange spot on his cheek, Wags his tail excitedly, Large, innocent eyes, Chubby build. The Dino family (Papa Dino, Mama Dino, and Dino Dan) are playing happily in a lush, green valley. The sun is shining, but a dark wind is starting to blow. in Lush Valley. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"The wind went whoosh, the sky turned gray. A big storm came to play! Papa Dino said, \"Oh my, oh me! We must find a safe place, you see!\" Dan began to cry.","illustrationPrompt":"The same Dino family looking worried. The sky is now gray and cloudy. Wind is picking up, bending the trees more. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1774486329842,"durationMs":7285,"retries":0,"promptLength":833,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A large Deep teal scales with a mustard yellow stripe down his back. Parasaurolophus, Medium Amber eyes with worried expression, Large, curved crest on head, Slightly chipped tooth, Broad chest, Small, friendly smile, Stocky build. A small Bright sky-blue scales with a sunny yellow tail. Parasaurolophus, Big-expressive Chocolate brown eyes with sad expression, Small crest just starting to grow, One small, bright orange spot on his cheek, Wags his tail excitedly, Large, innocent eyes, Chubby build. A large, dark storm cloud is forming. The wind is blowing fiercely. Papa Dino is looking worried, and Dino Dan is starting to cry. in Lush Valley. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"Mama Dino knew just what to do. \"A dance! A dance will see us through!\" She stomped her feet, she waved her arms. \"A happy dance will keep us safe from harms!\" So let us dance!","illustrationPrompt":"Mama Dino smiling, starting a silly dance. Papa Dino and Dan look surprised but hopeful. Wind is stronger now. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1774486329576,"durationMs":7019,"retries":0,"promptLength":597,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A large Soft lavender scales with a light pink belly. Parasaurolophus, Medium Emerald green eyes with determined expression, Slightly shorter crest than Papa Dino, A small flower tucked behind her ear (always), Gentle eyes, Graceful posture, Average build. Mama Dino is stomping her feet and waving her arms, starting a dance to ward off the storm. She has a determined and encouraging expression. in Lush Valley. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"Papa Dino joined the fun. He did a jig, beneath the sun, or what was left of sun. Little Dino Dan began to grin. He wiggled his tail, and spun around like a pin.","illustrationPrompt":"All three dinos doing a silly dance together. Papa Dino is doing a jig, Dan is wiggling his tail. The sky is getting darker. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1774486335684,"durationMs":6108,"retries":0,"promptLength":827,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A large Deep teal scales with a mustard yellow stripe down his back. Parasaurolophus, Medium Amber eyes with joyful expression, Large, curved crest on head, Slightly chipped tooth, Broad chest, Small, friendly smile, Stocky build. A small Bright sky-blue scales with a sunny yellow tail. Parasaurolophus, Big-expressive Chocolate brown eyes with happy expression, Small crest just starting to grow, One small, bright orange spot on his cheek, Wags his tail excitedly, Large, innocent eyes, Chubby build. Papa Dino joins Mama Dino in the dance, doing a jig. Dino Dan starts to grin and wiggle his tail, beginning to spin around. in Lush Valley. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"The wind blew hard, the trees all swayed. But the dinos danced, unafraid. They danced and danced with all their might, and filled the world with happy light. They stomped and swayed.","illustrationPrompt":"The Dino family dancing even more enthusiastically. The tornado is visible in the background, but still far away. Trees are bending severely. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1774486336327,"durationMs":6536,"retries":0,"promptLength":1061,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A large Deep teal scales with a mustard yellow stripe down his back. Parasaurolophus, Medium Amber eyes with joyful expression, Large, curved crest on head, Slightly chipped tooth, Broad chest, Small, friendly smile, Stocky build. A large Soft lavender scales with a light pink belly. Parasaurolophus, Medium Emerald green eyes with joyful expression, Slightly shorter crest than Papa Dino, A small flower tucked behind her ear (always), Gentle eyes, Graceful posture, Average build. A small Bright sky-blue scales with a sunny yellow tail. Parasaurolophus, Big-expressive Chocolate brown eyes with joyful expression, Small crest just starting to grow, One small, bright orange spot on his cheek, Wags his tail excitedly, Large, innocent eyes, Chubby build. The wind is blowing hard, and the trees are swaying, but the Dino family is dancing together, unafraid. in Lush Valley. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"The storm it swirled, a grumpy face. But the dance was filled with love and grace. The dinos danced, so full of glee, the storm it turned, for all to see. It started to slow.","illustrationPrompt":"The Dino family still dancing. The tornado is closer but looks less fierce, almost confused. Some light is breaking through the clouds. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1774486336940,"durationMs":7093,"retries":0,"promptLength":1080,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A large Deep teal scales with a mustard yellow stripe down his back. Parasaurolophus, Medium Amber eyes with joyful expression, Large, curved crest on head, Slightly chipped tooth, Broad chest, Small, friendly smile, Stocky build. A large Soft lavender scales with a light pink belly. Parasaurolophus, Medium Emerald green eyes with joyful expression, Slightly shorter crest than Papa Dino, A small flower tucked behind her ear (always), Gentle eyes, Graceful posture, Average build. A small Bright sky-blue scales with a sunny yellow tail. Parasaurolophus, Big-expressive Chocolate brown eyes with joyful expression, Small crest just starting to grow, One small, bright orange spot on his cheek, Wags his tail excitedly, Large, innocent eyes, Chubby build. The storm cloud has a grumpy face, but the dinos' dance is filled with love and grace. The storm is starting to slow down. in Lush Valley. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"The storm moved on, a gentle sigh. The sun peeked out from up on high. The dinos cheered, they jumped with joy. Their happy dance had saved the day, oh boy! What a dance!","illustrationPrompt":"The Dino family jumping for joy. The tornado is moving away in the background. The sun is shining brightly. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1774486343338,"durationMs":7650,"retries":0,"promptLength":1064,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A large Deep teal scales with a mustard yellow stripe down his back. Parasaurolophus, Medium Amber eyes with excited expression, Large, curved crest on head, Slightly chipped tooth, Broad chest, Small, friendly smile, Stocky build. A large Soft lavender scales with a light pink belly. Parasaurolophus, Medium Emerald green eyes with excited expression, Slightly shorter crest than Papa Dino, A small flower tucked behind her ear (always), Gentle eyes, Graceful posture, Average build. A small Bright sky-blue scales with a sunny yellow tail. Parasaurolophus, Big-expressive Chocolate brown eyes with excited expression, Small crest just starting to grow, One small, bright orange spot on his cheek, Wags his tail excitedly, Large, innocent eyes, Chubby build. The storm is moving away, and the sun is peeking out. The Dino family is cheering and jumping with joy. in Lush Valley. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"So if the wind begins to blow, and dark clouds fill the sky, just start to dance, with all your heart, and happy days are nigh! Dance with love and family!","illustrationPrompt":"The Dino family hugging and smiling. Rainbow in the sky. The valley is green and peaceful again. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1774486345780,"durationMs":9446,"retries":0,"promptLength":561,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A large Soft lavender scales with a light pink belly. Parasaurolophus, Medium Emerald green eyes with Calm and encouraging expression, Slightly shorter crest than Papa Dino, A small flower tucked behind her ear (always), Gentle eyes, Graceful posture, Average build. A general scene of children dancing, inspired by the dinos' dance, in a similarly lush valley. in Lush Valley. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}}],"generationMeta":{"textModel":"gemini-2.0-flash","imageProvider":"gemini","generatedAt":1774486303521,"totalDurationMs":48593,"textGenerationMs":1,"imageGenerationMs":64660